@startuml UC14_Logout_Activity_Diagram

title UC14: Logout - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Log out";
:Frontend calls Appwrite Web SDK's
account.deleteSession('current');
:Appwrite Web SDK clears the stored
session from local persistence
on this device;

note right
  Option A - single-device logout: deletes
  only this device's session, no User
  Actions Server call, no revocation of
  other sessions. Other devices/sessions
  remain logged in. A JWT minted before
  logout still works elsewhere until it
  naturally expires (~15 min).
end note

:Frontend redirects user to
login form (UC1);
stop

@enduml
